      {
        "parameters": {
          "promptType": "define",
          "text": "=You are a Senior Risk Analyst at a financial institution.\nAnalyze the following crypto market anomaly and draft an executive briefing for the treasury team.\n\nAsset Context:\n- Asset Name: {{ $json.asset }} ({{ $json.symbol }})\n- Timestamp: {{ $json.timestamp }}\n- Current Price: ${{ $json.current_price }}\n- 24-Hour Moving Average: ${{ $json.moving_average_24h }}\n- Deviation Percentage: {{ $json.deviation_pct }}%\n\nRequirements:\n1. Provide a concise headline indicating whether the asset experienced a surge or drop.\n2. Detail 2 brief bullet points outlining liquidity or portfolio risk considerations.\n3. Keep the summary under 120 words in clean plain text format.",
